{
    "_comment": [
        "Frontend-local settings schema. Deliberately the SAME shape as the schema the",
        "backend serves over CONFIG_SCHEMA (0x91), so SettingsView renders local and",
        "remote settings through one delegate family and adding a setting is one entry",
        "here plus one binding in app/Theme.qml.",
        "",
        "TWO LEVELS: groups render as sidebar sections, and each group holds SUBSECTIONS",
        "that render as one card each in the detail pane.",
        "",
        "THIS FILE IS THE CANONICAL SECTION LIST. A group id present here and in the",
        "backend's schema MERGES - 'general' shows the screensaver card below plus the",
        "backend's location card - and this file decides the order, label and icon. That",
        "is why 'media' and 'tesla' appear with no subsections of their own: they hold no",
        "frontend settings, and the entries exist only to place and name them. A backend",
        "group whose id is unknown here is appended rather than dropped, and a section",
        "that ends up with no subsections at all is hidden.",
        "",
        "Per-group keys: id, label, icon (a semantic name mapped to a resource by",
        "SettingsSidebar, not a file path), sections.",
        "",
        "Per-subsection keys: id, label, help (optional, under the card title),\nstatus (optional: names a runtime status widget rendered in the card -\n'backendProbe' is the reachability check), settings.",
        "",
        "Per-setting keys: key, type (bool|int|float|string|enum|action), label, help,",
        "unit, min/max/step (numeric), maxLabel (slider top-stop text), options\n(enum), default, apply, editor,\nwarnBelow/warnAbove + warnMessage (advisory caution, never blocks a write),\nrelevantWhen {key, equals|notEquals} (fades the row while another setting\nmakes it meaningless - faded, never disabled, so it stays editable).",
        "editor: numeric settings get a [-] value [+] stepper by default; set",
        "        'slider' only for coarse dials where the exact number does not",
        "        matter (a 65534-step slider is unusable, see SettingNumber).",
        "",
        "type 'action' is a BUTTON, not a value: nothing is stored or persisted.",
        "It carries actionLabel and optionally requiresConnection, and its key names",
        "a handler in Settings::invokeAction.",
        "",
        "apply: 'live'    - a QML binding through Theme picks it up immediately;",
        "       'restart' - consumed once at startup (AppConfig), so it needs an app",
        "                   restart. The view badges these rows.",
        "",
        "A setting may also declare 'env': the named environment variable (or .env",
        "entry) supplies that setting's DEFAULT, so an existing deployment keeps",
        "working until the user overrides it here. Precedence: schema default <",
        "env/.env < saved user override.",
        "",
        "Values the user changes are written to frontend_config.json under",
        "~/.config/Tesla-Homedash/ (see core/settings.cpp) - never back into this bundled",
        "file, which is compiled into the binary and supplies only the defaults."
    ],
    "groups": [
        {
            "id": "general",
            "icon": "app",
            "label": "Yleinen",
            "sections": [
                {
                    "id": "display",
                    "label": "Näyttö",
                    "settings": [
                        {
                            "key": "fullscreen",
                            "type": "bool",
                            "env": "TESLA_HOMEDASH_FULLSCREEN",
                            "label": "Koko näyttö",
                            "help": "Piilottaa ikkunan kehykset. Kokoluku 1280×800 vapautetaan, jotta paneeli täyttää ruudun.",
                            "default": false,
                            "apply": "live"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "screensaver",
                    "label": "Näytönsäästäjä",
                    "help": "Kuvaesitys, kun näyttöä ei ole koskettu hetkeen. Ilman kuvakansiota näytönsäästäjä ei käynnisty.",
                    "settings": [
                        {
                            "key": "screensaverEnabled",
                            "type": "bool",
                            "label": "Näytönsäästäjä",
                            "help": "Vaatii alla määritellyn kuvakansion.",
                            "default": true,
                            "apply": "live"
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "screensaverTimeoutMin",
                            "type": "int",
                            "env": "TESLA_HOMEDASH_SCREENSAVER_TIMEOUT_MIN",
                            "label": "Käynnistysviive",
                            "help": "Kuinka kauan kosketuksetta ennen näytönsäästäjää.",
                            "unit": "min",
                            "min": 1,
                            "max": 240,
                            "step": 1,
                            "default": 30,
                            "apply": "live",
                            "relevantWhen": {
                                "key": "screensaverEnabled",
                                "equals": true
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "screensaverAdvanceSec",
                            "type": "int",
                            "label": "Kuvan vaihtoväli",
                            "unit": "s",
                            "min": 2,
                            "max": 120,
                            "step": 1,
                            "default": 8,
                            "apply": "live",
                            "relevantWhen": {
                                "key": "screensaverEnabled",
                                "equals": true
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "screensaverStackCount",
                            "editor": "slider",
                            "type": "int",
                            "label": "Kuvapinon koko",
                            "help": "Montako kuvaa pinossa näkyy kerrallaan.",
                            "min": 3,
                            "max": 30,
                            "step": 1,
                            "default": 10,
                            "apply": "live",
                            "relevantWhen": {
                                "key": "screensaverEnabled",
                                "equals": true
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "screensaverDir",
                            "type": "string",
                            "env": "TESLA_HOMEDASH_SCREENSAVER_DIR",
                            "label": "Kuvakansio",
                            "help": "Polku kansioon, jonka kuvat näytönsäästäjä näyttää. Tyhjä = näytönsäästäjä ei käynnisty.",
                            "nullable": true,
                            "default": "",
                            "apply": "live"
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "screenOffEnabled",
                            "type": "bool",
                            "label": "Näytön sammutus",
                            "help": "Sammuttaa taustavalon kokonaan wlopm:llä. Kosketus herättää näytön, eikä kosketus lakkaa toimimasta pimeänäkään.",
                            "default": false,
                            "apply": "live"
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "screenOffMin",
                            "type": "int",
                            "label": "Sammutusviive",
                            "help": "Käyttämättömyysaika ennen sammutusta. Aseta pidemmäksi kuin näytönsäästäjän käynnistysviive, muuten kuvaesitys jää pimeään.",
                            "unit": "min",
                            "min": 1,
                            "max": 240,
                            "step": 1,
                            "default": 60,
                            "apply": "live",
                            "relevantWhen": {
                                "key": "screenOffEnabled",
                                "equals": true
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "extras",
                    "label": "Lisäasetukset",
                    "settings": [
                        {
                            "key": "lunaEnabled",
                            "type": "bool",
                            "label": "Luna",
                            "help": "Koiramuistomerkki kulkee työpöydän alalaidassa.",
                            "default": false,
                            "apply": "live"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
